{"format":"adventure-reader-v1","title":"ゲームブック分岐スタイルデモ","pages":[{"id":"manuscript-export","title":"ゲームブック分岐スタイルデモ","blocks":[{"kind":"text","text":"SP-072 Phase 5 のゲームブック分岐UIスタイルを確認するためのサンプルです。\n\nReader Preview (Alt+Shift+R) で各スタイルの表示を確認してください。"},{"kind":"rule"},{"kind":"heading","text":"プロローグ","id":"プロローグ"},{"kind":"text","text":"あなたは探偵事務所の前に立っている。ドアには「調査依頼受付中」の札がかかっている。"},{"kind":"rule"},{"kind":"heading","text":"選択: 依頼の受け方","id":"選択-依頼の受け方"},{"kind":"heading","text":"デフォルトスタイル (リンクのみ)","id":"デフォルトスタイル-リンクのみ"},{"kind":"text","text":"通常のMarkdownリンクによる分岐:"},{"kind":"link","text":"事務所に入る","target":"#%E4%BA%8B%E5%8B%99%E6%89%80","role":""},{"kind":"link","text":"通り過ぎる","target":"#%E8%B7%AF%E5%9C%B0%E8%A3%8F","role":""},{"kind":"rule"},{"kind":"heading","text":"カードスタイル","id":"カードスタイル"},{"kind":"link","text":"事務所に入る -- 正面から堂々と","target":"#%E4%BA%8B%E5%8B%99%E6%89%80","role":"card"},{"kind":"link","text":"裏口から回る -- 様子を探ってから","target":"#%E8%A3%8F%E5%8F%A3","role":"card"},{"kind":"link","text":"通り過ぎる -- 今日はやめておこう","target":"#%E8%B7%AF%E5%9C%B0%E8%A3%8F","role":"card"},{"kind":"rule"},{"kind":"heading","text":"ボタンスタイル","id":"ボタンスタイル"},{"kind":"link","text":"依頼を受ける","target":"#%E4%BA%8B%E5%8B%99%E6%89%80","role":"button"},{"kind":"link","text":"断る","target":"#%E8%B7%AF%E5%9C%B0%E8%A3%8F","role":"button"},{"kind":"rule"},{"kind":"heading","text":"事務所","id":"事務所"},{"kind":"text","text":"依頼人は若い女性だった。彼女は震える手で一枚の写真を差し出した。"},{"kind":"dialog","children":[{"kind":"dialog-body","children":[{"kind":"label","text":"依頼人"},{"kind":"text","text":"この人を......探してほしいんです。\n三日前から連絡が取れなくて。"}]}],"role":"left bubble"},{"kind":"text","text":"写真には、眼鏡をかけた中年の男性が写っている。"},{"kind":"link","text":"調査を引き受ける","target":"#%E8%AA%BF%E6%9F%BB%E9%96%8B%E5%A7%8B","role":""},{"kind":"link","text":"詳しく話を聞く","target":"#%E8%A9%B3%E7%B4%B0","role":""},{"kind":"rule"},{"kind":"heading","text":"裏口","id":"裏口"},{"kind":"text","text":"裏口のドアは開いていた。中から話し声が聞こえる。"},{"kind":"textbox","children":[{"kind":"text","text":"誰かが既に来ている。依頼人だろうか、それとも......"}],"role":"monologue"},{"kind":"link","text":"中に入る","target":"#%E4%BA%8B%E5%8B%99%E6%89%80","role":""},{"kind":"link","text":"聞き耳を立てる","target":"#%E7%9B%97%E8%81%B4","role":""},{"kind":"rule"},{"kind":"heading","text":"路地裏","id":"路地裏"},{"kind":"text","text":"事務所を通り過ぎて路地裏に入ると、壁に貼り紙があった。"},{"kind":"textbox","children":[{"kind":"text","text":"「尋ね人: 鈴木一郎 (52歳)。心当たりのある方はXXX-XXXX-XXXXまでご連絡ください」"}],"role":"narration"},{"kind":"dialog","children":[{"kind":"dialog-body","children":[{"kind":"label","text":"主人公"},{"kind":"text","text":"......これは偶然か?"}]}],"role":"right default"},{"kind":"link","text":"事務所に戻る","target":"#%E4%BA%8B%E5%8B%99%E6%89%80","role":""},{"kind":"link","text":"独自に調査する","target":"#%E8%AA%BF%E6%9F%BB%E9%96%8B%E5%A7%8B","role":""},{"kind":"rule"},{"kind":"heading","text":"詳細","id":"詳細"},{"kind":"dialog","children":[{"kind":"dialog-body","children":[{"kind":"label","text":"依頼人"},{"kind":"text","text":"夫は三日前、「少し出かけてくる」と言って出ていきました。\n普段なら数時間で帰ってくるのに、そのまま......"}]}],"role":"left default"},{"kind":"dialog","children":[{"kind":"dialog-body","children":[{"kind":"label","text":"主人公"},{"kind":"text","text":"最後に連絡があったのは?"}]}],"role":"right default"},{"kind":"dialog","children":[{"kind":"dialog-body","children":[{"kind":"label","text":"依頼人"},{"kind":"text","text":"出かけた日の夜、短いメッセージが一通だけ。\n「心配するな、すぐ帰る」と。"}]}],"role":"left bordered"},{"kind":"link","text":"調査を引き受ける","target":"#%E8%AA%BF%E6%9F%BB%E9%96%8B%E5%A7%8B","role":""},{"kind":"rule"},{"kind":"heading","text":"盗聴","id":"盗聴"},{"kind":"text","text":"壁に耳を当てると、二人の会話が聞こえた。"},{"kind":"text","text":"「"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"text","text":"あ"},{"kind":"text","text":"の"},{"kind":"text","text":"件"},{"kind":"text","text":"は"},{"kind":"text","text":"ど"},{"kind":"text","text":"う"},{"kind":"text","text":"な"},{"kind":"text","text":"っ"},{"kind":"text","text":"た"},{"kind":"text","text":"」"},{"kind":"text","text":"「"},{"kind":"text","text":"問"},{"kind":"text","text":"題"},{"kind":"text","text":"な"},{"kind":"text","text":"い"},{"kind":"text","text":"。"},{"kind":"text","text":"証"},{"kind":"text","text":"拠"},{"kind":"text","text":"は"},{"kind":"text","text":"処"},{"kind":"text","text":"分"},{"kind":"text","text":"し"},{"kind":"text","text":"た"},{"kind":"text","text":"」"},{"kind":"text","text":"「"},{"kind":"text","text":"念"},{"kind":"text","text":"の"},{"kind":"text","text":"た"},{"kind":"text","text":"め"},{"kind":"text","text":"、"},{"kind":"text","text":"あ"},{"kind":"text","text":"の"},{"kind":"text","text":"探"},{"kind":"text","text":"偵"},{"kind":"text","text":"に"},{"kind":"text","text":"も"},{"kind":"text","text":"目"},{"kind":"text","text":"を"},{"kind":"text","text":"光"},{"kind":"text","text":"ら"},{"kind":"text","text":"せ"},{"kind":"text","text":"ろ"},{"kind":"text","text":"」"},{"kind":"text","text":"「......あの件はどうなった」\n「問題ない。証拠は処分した」\n「念のため、あの探偵にも目を光らせろ」"},{"kind":"text","text":"探偵——自分のことだろうか。"},{"kind":"link","text":"急いで事務所に入る","target":"#%E4%BA%8B%E5%8B%99%E6%89%80","role":""},{"kind":"link","text":"この場を離れる","target":"#%E8%B7%AF%E5%9C%B0%E8%A3%8F","role":""},{"kind":"rule"},{"kind":"heading","text":"調査開始","id":"調査開始"},{"kind":"text","text":"手がかりは三つ。どこから調べるか。"},{"kind":"heading","text":"カードスタイルでの三択","id":"カードスタイルでの三択"},{"kind":"link","text":"最後のメッセージの発信地を特定する","target":"#%E3%82%A8%E3%83%B3%E3%83%87%E3%82%A3%E3%83%B3%E3%82%B0","role":"card"},{"kind":"link","text":"依頼人の夫の職場を訪ねる","target":"#%E3%82%A8%E3%83%B3%E3%83%87%E3%82%A3%E3%83%B3%E3%82%B0","role":"card"},{"kind":"link","text":"路地裏の貼り紙の電話番号に連絡する","target":"#%E3%82%A8%E3%83%B3%E3%83%87%E3%82%A3%E3%83%B3%E3%82%B0","role":"card"},{"kind":"rule"},{"kind":"heading","text":"エンディング","id":"エンディング"},{"kind":"reveal","children":[{"kind":"text","text":"調査は始まったばかりだ。\n真実にたどり着くまで、まだ長い道のりが待っている。"}],"role":"fade-in"},{"kind":"label","text":"-- デモ終了 --"},{"kind":"text","text":"このデモで使用した機能:"},{"kind":"text","text":"・三つの分岐スタイル (default / card / button)"},{"kind":"text","text":"・ダイアログボックス (4スタイル)"},{"kind":"text","text":"・テキストボックスプリセット (monologue / narration)"},{"kind":"text","text":"・テクスチャオーバーレイ (paper)"},{"kind":"text","text":"・タイピング演出 (click)"},{"kind":"text","text":"・スクロール連動 (fade-in)"},{"kind":"text","text":"・テキストアニメーション (fade)"}]}],"images":[],"style":{"background":"#1e1e1e","foreground":"#d4d4d4","sans":false,"width":720,"link":"#555555","reducedMotion":false}}